<title>UK: Paribas appoints global head of fixed income sales.</title>
<headline>Paribas appoints global head of fixed income sales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas has appointed Bruno Cappuccini global head of sales for the fixed-income business as part of a bid to strengthen its London-based operations, the bank said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;It clearly marks our strongest commitment yet to a unified sales structure and philosophy,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
